    "title": "Omaha advocate continues speaking out for positive change - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Chapman ,\n4 hours ago OMAHA, Neb. (WOWT) - An Omaha man who has a history of advocating for the poor and underserved in our community took his concerns on the road. Paul Feilmann recently returned from Minneapolis. He’s back home now hoping to spread the word of religious leaders on how immigrants should be treated in our country. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
